/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig

# cargo-mutants output (regenerable; results of record live in PR bodies / CI)
/mutants.out*

# Python bytecode (the gate helper is source-of-record only)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# AI agent tool working directories — kept local, never committed. Project
# guidance is centralized in AGENTS.md (with CLAUDE.md symlinked to it); these
# per-tool dirs hold local session/config scaffolding that does not belong in
# the repo. Trailing slashes match directories only, so the CLAUDE.md /
# AGENTS.md files are untouched by the .claude/ / .agents/ patterns.
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.opencode/
.gemini/
.pi/
.continue/
.windsurf/
.aider*/
.agents/

# Guidance docs stay tracked. These negations are belt-and-suspenders for the
# untracked case only (a tracked file is unaffected by ignore rules); git is
# last-match-wins, so they guard against a broader pattern added ABOVE and must
# remain the last matching rules for these paths — a broader ignore added below
# would override them.
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
/dist
